{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中， Margaret 傅季馨教大家製作一道香氣四溢的「椒鹽豬扒伴蔥油撈麵」。外酥內嫩的椒鹽豬扒配上濃郁的自製蔥油撈麵，交織出層次豐富的港式風味，做法清晰易學，大家不妨在家挑戰看看！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材與調味料準備</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">製作步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"95b87c44-d677-4b0d-aa31-b6f7659b7b8f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xAoHt3KaJ31790764606.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"95b87c44-d677-4b0d-aa31-b6f7659b7b8f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T11:18:44.877152+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}